~ start
Narrator: The next day, Ayyan meets his friend, Hamza.

if GameState.fields.get("lie_about_not_going", true):
	=> confront_lie
else:
	=> confront_truth

~ confront_truth
Hamza [#mood=smile]: Ayyan! There you are.
Hamza [#mood=frown]: Hey... your mother came by yesterday.

Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: (Oh no.)
Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: What did she say?

Hamza [#mood=frown]: She told me you're thinking of doing something dangerous.
Hamza [#mood=angry]: As your childhood friend, I can never allow you to put yourself at risk.
Hamza: Not to mention, your mother is worried sick about you!

Ayyan [#mood=shock]: (This is a problem, what do I do now...)
- Be honest with him
	Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: ...Alright. Listen to me, Hamza.
	Ayyan: This is a serious matter we're dealing with.

	Hamza [#mood=neutral]: I'm listening.

	Ayyan: I got a mysterious letter yesterday, inviting me to the Blackhood Mansion.
	Hamza [#mood=shock]: The Blackhood Mansion? That place has been abandoned for years!

	Ayyan [#mood=angry]: It says they know the truth about my father!
	Ayyan: I'm sorry, Hamza, but I need to go there.

	Hamza [#mood=neutral]: ...
	Hamza [#mood=neutral]: In that case... take me with you.
	Hamza: I can't let you go into danger alone.
	Hamza: How would I face your mother if something were to happen to you?

	- Agree
		Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: ...Fine, if you insist.
		Ayyan [#mood=smile]: Tomorrow, let us go there together!
		do GameState.fields["next_act"] = "act_4b"
		=> END
	- Refuse
		Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: I can't, Hamza. They said not to bring anyone.
		Ayyan: Besides, I can't put others at risk.
		Ayyan: This is something only I must deal with.
		=> reject_hamza

- Tell him to back off
	Ayyan [#mood=frown]: Well, instead of worrying about me...
	Ayyan [#mood=angry]: Why doesn't everyone mind their own damn business!
	Ayyan: I don't need you all to treat me like a kid! I can handle myself!

	Hamza [#mood=shock]: ...
	=> reject_hamza

~ confront_lie
Hamza [#mood=smile]: Hey Ayyan! Good timing, I was just about to look for you.
Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: Hamza. What's up?

Hamza [#mood=neutral]: Nothing much, just wanted to catch up.
Hamza: You've seemed... distracted lately.

Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: (I guess I haven't been hiding it as well as I thought.)

Hamza [#mood=frown]: Is everything alright? You can tell me, you know.

Ayyan [#mood=shock]: (Should I tell him... He deserves to know, at the very least.)
- Tell him the truth
	Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: Actually... there's something I need to tell you.

	Hamza [#mood=neutral]: Oh?

	Ayyan: Yesterday, I received a strange letter.
	Ayyan [#mood=frown]: It was an invitation, to the Blackhood Mansion.

	Hamza [#mood=shock]: The Blackhood Mansion? That place has been abandoned for years!

	Ayyan [#mood=angry]: The letter said they know the truth about my father.
	Ayyan: I have to go there, Hamza. I need answers.

	Hamza [#mood=frown]: ...
	Hamza: Ayyan, that sounds dangerous. You can't just walk into something like that alone.
	Hamza: Let me come with you.

	- Agree
		Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: ...Alright. Fine, if you insist.
		Ayyan [#mood=smile]: Tomorrow, let's go there together.
		do GameState.fields["next_act"] = "act_4b"
		
		=> END
	- Refuse
		Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: I can't, Hamza. They said not to bring anyone.
		Ayyan: Besides, I can't put you in danger too.
		Ayyan: This is something only I must deal with.
		=> reject_hamza

- Keep it to himself
	Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: It's nothing, really. Just tired, that's all.

	Hamza [#mood=frown]: ...If you say so.
	Hamza: You know I'm here if you change your mind, right?

	Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: Yeah. I know.
	do GameState.fields["next_act"] = "act_4a"
	=> END

~ reject_hamza
Hamza [#mood=sad]: Ayyan...
Hamza: I just don't want you to do something that would bring you harm.

Ayyan [#mood=neutral]: ...

Hamza [#mood=angry]: We're just trying to keep you safe, can't you see that!
Hamza [#mood=sad]: But if you've made your decision... there is nothing I can do to stop you.
Hamza: Good luck, my friend... stay safe.
do GameState.fields["next_act"] = "act_4a"

=> END